  Z N L I T E  /  A U R O R A
  Your desktop. Your rules.

  Super+Return          Terminal       Super+D       Launcher
  Super+Shift+C         Reload Sway    Ctrl+Alt+F2    Rescue console
  znlite customize init                Make editable copies of defaults
  znlite customize preset minimal      Reduce decoration
  znlite mirror status                 Mirror measurements and ownership
  znlite doctor                        Read-only system report
  sudo znlite update                   Review package updates

  Live changes need persistence or installation to survive a reboot.
